  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. 12 and 33\n\n__**8 × 3**__ - __**33 ÷ 6**__ + 18 = 12\n\n⇒ __**24**__** **- 5.5 __**+ 18**__ = 12\n\n⇒ __**42 - 5.5**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 36.5 ≠ 12\n\n2. 12 and 18\n\n__**8 × 3**__ - __**18 ÷ 6**__ + 12 = 33\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 3 __**+ 12**__ = 33\n\n⇒ __**36 - 3**__ = 33\n\n⇒ 33 = 33\n\n3. 18 and 33\n\n__**8 × 3**__ - __**12 ÷ 6**__ + 33 = 18\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 2 __**+ 33**__ = 18\n\n⇒ __**57 - 2**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 55 ≠ 18\n\n4. 8 and 3\n\n__**3 × 8**__ - __**12 ÷ 6**__ + 18 = 33\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 2 __**+ 18**__ = 33\n\n⇒ __**42 - 2**__ = 33\n\n⇒ 40 ≠ 33\n\nHence, '**12 and 18**' is the correct answer.",
